      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in OnAir Pro 4.17</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Default cooldown reduced from 5s to 3s for new installations</li>
          <li>New transcription_segment_minutes config option (default: 5) controls Whisper segmentation</li>
          <li>Configuration changes take effect immediately without app restart</li>
          <li>OnAir icon now pulses when recording</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
